ings Alight discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":257,"player":1,"text":"Fire was always available. What is new is doing it to somebody deliberately, from a distance, and then walking away while it continues.","kind":"info"},{"turn":257,"player":1,"text":"Research begins: The Cold Shoulder.","kind":"research"},{"turn":257,"player":2,"text":"The Dry Mound grows to 7.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":257,"player":3,"text":"Wanderer finishes a road.","kind":"good","at":[48,23]},{"turn":257,"player":3,"text":"Good Enough Crossing grows to 5.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":257,"player":0,"text":"Axethrower throws its axe at Warband.","kind":"combat","cue":"axe-throw","at":[39,27],"actor":485},{"turn":257,"player":3,"text":"Warband defeats Axethrower after 5 rounds.","kind":"combat","at":[38,28],"actor":410},{"turn":257,"player":0,"text":"Axethrower is wiped out.","kind":"bad","at":[38,28]},{"turn":258,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":258,"player":0,"text":"Peon finishes the road: there is nothing left to lay that way.","kind":"good","at":[39,15]},{"turn":258,"player":1,"text":"Duke's Rest completes Knight.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":258,"player":1,"text":"Thornwall completes Two Archers.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":258,"player":0,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram tear up the road.","kind":"bad","at":[36,27]},{"turn":258,"player":1,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram tear up the road.","kind":"info","at":[36,27]},{"turn":258,"player":3,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram tear up the road.","kind":"bad","at":[36,27]},{"turn":258,"player":1,"text":"One of the figures out there is not what it has been pretending to be.","kind":"good","at":[28,12]},{"turn":258,"player":2,"text":"The First Hollow has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":258,"player":2,"text":"Twenty Chambers completes Fodder-caste.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":258,"player":2,"text":"Asking Around discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":258,"player":2,"text":"People will tell you a startling amount about their neighbours if you stand near them and look interested. They will tell you more if you buy the next round, but that is a separate advance and somebody is still costing it.","kind":"info"},{"turn":258,"player":2,"text":"Research begins: A Word In The Wrong Ear.","kind":"research"},{"turn":258,"player":1,"text":"A Ballista was offered money to change sides, and reported it. The offer was The Hive As It Stands's.","kind":"bad","at":[28,13]},{"turn":258,"player":2,"text":"Ballista refused us, and told somebody. They know whose offer it was.","kind":"bad","at":[28,13]},{"turn":258,"player":3,"text":"Warband defeats Goblin Sapper after 11 rounds.","kind":"combat","at":[38,28],"actor":410},{"turn":258,"player":0,"text":"Goblin Sapper goes up, taking 1 unit(s) with it.","kind":"combat","cue":"explosion","at":[38,28]},{"turn":258,"player":3,"text":"A Goblin Sapper goes up beside 1 of your unit(s).","kind":"bad","cue":"explosion","at":[38,28]},{"turn":258,"player":0,"text":"Goblin Sapper is wiped out.","kind":"bad","at":[38,28]},{"turn":259,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole grows to 16.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":259,"player":0,"text":"Setting Things Alight discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":259,"player":0,"text":"Fire was always available. What is new is doing it to somebody deliberately, from a distance, and then walking away while it continues.","kind":"info"},{"turn":259,"player":0,"text":"Research begins: The Cold Shoulder.","kind":"research"},{"turn":259,"player":1,"text":"Two Archers holds against Axethrower.","kind":"combat","at":[34,19],"actor":196},{"turn":259,"player":0,"text":"Axethrower is destroyed attacking.","kind":"bad","at":[35,19]},{"turn":259,"player":1,"text":"Fairhaven completes Two Archers.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":259,"player":1,"text":"Second Hollow completes Two Archers.",